      "blocks": {
        "review-1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "The crust I'd been chasing for years",
            "text": "<p>I'd given up on a steakhouse sear at home. A proper preheat, a little oil, and the ribeye lifted on its own with a crust I've only had in restaurants. The coated pan went to recycling the same week.</p>",
            "author": "Lotte V.",
            "product_label": "Forge Pan · 28 cm",
            "verified": true
          }
        },
        "review-2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Bought one, then the set",
            "text": "<p>Started with the 24 cm and ordered the Trio within a month. Eggs in the small one, everything else in the 28. Hob, oven, dishwasher — they still look new.</p>",
            "author": "Jonas B.",
            "product_label": "The Trio",
            "verified": true
          }
        },
        "review-3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 4,
            "title": "A learning curve, then love",
            "text": "<p>My first eggs stuck, entirely my fault — I rushed the preheat. Once I used the water-droplet test it became the easiest pan I own. Heavier than my old one, in a good way.</p>",
            "author": "Anouk de G.",
            "product_label": "Forge Pan · 24 cm",
            "verified": true
          }
        },
        "review-4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Real wok heat on induction",
            "text": "<p>Induction and woks rarely get along. This one sits flat, heats fast and holds its temperature when the noodles go in. The helper handle makes tossing easy.</p>",
            "author": "Marco R.",
            "product_label": "Forge Wok · 34 cm",
            "verified": true
          }
        },
        "review-5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Balanced like it was made for me",
            "text": "<p>Sharp out of the box, a beautiful pattern, and the red collar makes it look like part of the set. Onions, herbs, a whole chicken — effortless.</p>",
            "author": "Rania K.",
            "product_label": "Damascus Chef Knife",
            "verified": true
          }
        },
        "review-6": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Replaced an entire cupboard",
            "text": "<p>We swapped eleven tired pans for seven pieces that actually work. The stockpot was the surprise: even heat across the base and nothing catching on long braises.</p>",
            "author": "Erik S.",
            "product_label": "The Chef's Collection",
            "verified": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
