        "padding_bottom": 120
      },
      "blocks": {
        "question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which size should I choose?",
            "answer": "<p>For one or two people, the 24 cm is the everyday all-rounder. For families or two steaks at once, choose 28 cm. 20 cm is perfect for eggs and sauces; 32 cm is for cooking for a crowd. Most kitchens end up with two sizes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Pan, wok or sauté pan — which first?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with the Forge Pan: it sears, fries and finishes in the oven. Add the Forge Wok if you stir-fry weekly, or the Sauté Pan for braises, sauces and one-pan dinners with a lid.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are the sets better value?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, and transparently so. Every set is priced below the total of its pieces at our own single-piece prices: The Trio saves €38, The Chef's Collection €135 and The Signature Kitchen €243.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do lids fit across pieces?",
            "answer": "<p>Tempered glass lids come in 20, 24 and 28 cm and fit any VOLKARA pan or pot of the same diameter.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it work on my hob?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — gas, induction, ceramic, electric and halogen, plus oven and grill to 260°C.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it isn't right for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Cook with it for 60 days. If it isn't the best pan you own, send it back and we'll refund the purchase price.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
